OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells to begin today,
OL,6,Fbut rain or showers across Kent
OL,7,Fgradually spread westwards through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. These are likely to turn
OL,9,Fheavy and perhaps thundery, although
OL,10,Fpredominantly across Kent. Feeling
OL,11,Frather cool. Windy along the Kent
OL,12,Fcoast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRather cloudy overnight with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain or showers, some of
OL,16,Fwhich could be heavy at times. Likely
OL,17,Fbecoming drier towards dawn with some
OL,18,Fclear spells developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
