OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA dry and bright start across
OL,6,Fthe region with sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping. Tending to cloud over a
OL,8,Flittle through the afternoon,
OL,9,Fespecially in the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FOften
OL,12,Fcloudy with a chance of occasional
OL,13,Frain or showers on Tuesday and
OL,14,FWednesday, but also some drier
OL,15,Fperiods, especially later on Thursday.
OL,16,FTemperatures generally near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
